[00:14.92]1. “Glory in the heights above”—
[00:29.85]Good news for all men—
[00:34.46]When God’s Son arrived in Bethlehem.
[00:46.08]Hope for those who mourn,
[00:51.16]A Savior has been born!
[00:54.16](Chorus)
[00:57.16]Good news, this good news—
[01:03.16]Joy for all mankind—
[01:09.16]Praise Jah for his light!
[01:20.73]Good news, this good news—
[01:26.23]Preach with all your might.
[01:31.73]Good news, Christ is born—
[01:39.55]The way, the truth, the life.
[01:51.98]2. He will reign for righteousness.
[02:04.41]Peace he will provide.
[02:12.21]Jesus is the way to endless life.
[02:23.71]Truth he will defend.
[02:28.71]His Kingdom will not end.
[02:38.30](Chorus)
[02:41.18]Good news, this good news—
[02:44.06]Joy for all mankind—
[02:46.94]Praise Jah for his light!
[02:58.46]Good news, this good news—
[03:03.96]Preach with all your might.
[03:09.96]Good news, Christ is born—
[03:17.28]The way, the truth, the life.
